			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young elegant woman whose face and calm intense appearance come from <Picture 1>; she is portrayed as a wealthy heiress named Ye Hongling, with a stern, domineering gaze, immaculate makeup, dark hair in a neat updo, and a composed but powerful posture.\n<Subject 2> is the formal white luxury outfit from <Picture 2>, consisting of a tailored ivory-white long jacket with a high collar, structured shoulders, decorative brooch, matching gold statement earrings, and white lace high heels with pearl embellishments; it is worn by <Subject 1> during her dramatic entrance.\n<Subject 3> is the bustling banquet crowd in an opulent party hall, including guests holding champagne glasses, mingling, reacting, and turning toward the entrance.\n<Subject 4> is the banquet hall entrance with large doors that are forcefully opened by bodyguards.\n<Subject 5> is the group of bodyguards in dark formal suits who rush in and slam open the banquet hall doors.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reference] A fast-paced cinematic banquet confrontation in 15 seconds: the party is interrupted by bodyguards bursting through the doors, then <Subject 1> enters wearing <Subject 2>, commands the room with a sharp aristocratic stare, and delivers one exact line in Chinese before the crowd falls into stunned attention.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 2] face reference for <Subject 1>): fully_preserved - the woman’s facial structure, skin tone, hair arrangement, and neutral-intense expression are directly carried into the target.\n<Picture 2> ([Shot 2] wardrobe reference for <Subject 2>): fully_preserved - the ivory formal jacket, brooch, earrings, and white lace heels are reproduced as the heiress outfit.\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - her identity, refined beauty, and severe commanding presence remain the central visual focus.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the outfit is shown as the main costume for the dramatic entrance.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): partially_preserved - the lively banquet atmosphere, guests, and champagne interaction remain, but the crowd’s composition and exact arrangement may shift for cinematic pacing.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): partially_preserved - the banquet hall doorway remains a key location, but the framing and motion are adapted for a dramatic entrance beat.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): partially_preserved - the bodyguards’ forceful doorway breach remains, though their specific number and positions may vary naturally.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe video uses a polished modern luxury-drama look with rich banquet lighting, crisp detail, and cinematic contrast. The pacing is fast and rhythmic, with smooth natural motion, stable framing, and sharp reaction beats that heighten the confrontation.\n\n[Shot 1] A grand banquet hall glows with warm chandeliers, crystal glassware, and dense social activity. <Subject 3> fills the room in elegant evening wear, raising champagne glasses and talking animatedly around long tables and gold decor. At the back, <Subject 4> suddenly jolts open as <Subject 5> slam through the doors with force, scattering attention across the room. The camera starts in a wide establishing view, then pushes in with a quick handheld glide toward the entrance as guests freeze and turn. Glasses tilt, shoulders pivot, and the atmosphere shifts from celebratory to tense in a single beat.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.200, the camera cuts to a cinematic hero entrance from the doorway. <Subject 1> steps forward wearing <Subject 2>, her posture upright and controlled, her gaze cold and elevated as she scans the banquet room with quiet authority. The outfit catches the light: the ivory jacket is sharply tailored, the gold earrings gleam, and the pearl-accented heels land cleanly and deliberately on the floor. The shot begins with her silhouette at the threshold, then tracks forward in a smooth medium push-in as the crowd parts. Her face resolves into a close-up as she stops center frame, eyes locked on the room with a superior, unblinking stare.\n\n<Subject 1> (S1) says, <d>[Chinese] 没有我叶红玲，你们开的哪门子宴会！</d>\n\nThe line lands with precise lip sync and a hard emotional hit. Guests in <Subject 3> recoil, some turning fully toward her, others exchanging stunned looks. The camera holds a brief low-angle close-up to emphasize her dominance, then ends on her steady expression as the banquet room remains tense and silent.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe banquet ambience is lively at the start, with overlapping guest chatter, soft glass clinks, and faint footsteps across a polished floor. When <Subject 5> bursts in, the soundscape surges with heavy door impacts, abrupt crowd reactions, and a sharp burst of movement through the room. The copied ambience layer from <Audio 1> is not available, so recreate the environment with realistic banquet room reverberation, crowd gasp accents, and tense silence after the entrance line.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA fast, cinematic, high-impact orchestral score underscores the scene with rapid percussion, dramatic string pulses, and a luxury-drama trailer feel. The music should rise during the door crash, peak under <Subject 1>'s entrance, then briefly drop back to a suspenseful sustain after the spoken line."
